# Deployment-specific subagent persona configs may reference (by env-var
# NAME, never by value) provider keys and may contain private prompt
# text. Keep them out of git. The committed scaffolding is the README,
# the example config, and the example prompt.
*.json
prompt-*.txt

# ...but keep the shipped examples/scaffolding:
!*.json.example
!prompt-researcher.txt
!README.md
!.gitkeep
